<title>SRI LANKA: Hayleys up 4.3 pct on results.</title>
<headline>Hayleys up 4.3 pct on results.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Hayleys Ltd rose 4.26 percent or 10 rupees to 245 in early Friday trading, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;The share is rising due to the good results for the year to March,&quot; said a local broker.</p>
<p>The company earlier reported net profits for the financial year ended March 31, rose 32.5 percent to 283.15 million rupees, from 213.74 million in the previous year.</p>
<p>Hayleys' main areas of activity are managing plantations, manufacturing rubber gloves and activated carbon for export.</p>
<p>The company is one of three diversified blue chip conglomerates trading in Colombo.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
